WEBVTT

00:09:57.945 --> 00:10:00.700
They say that all the growth-enhancing innovations

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.126
are behind us.

00:10:02.126 --> 00:10:05.440
And every time I hear this, I can't help thinking that

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:07.408
even back in the Stone Age,

00:10:07.408 --> 00:10:09.697
there must have been a group of cavemen

00:10:09.697 --> 00:10:11.576
sitting around a fire one day

00:10:11.576 --> 00:10:13.102
looking very grumpy,

00:10:13.102 --> 00:10:15.828
and looking disapprovingly
at another group of cavemen

00:10:15.828 --> 00:10:17.997
rolling a stone wheel up and down a hill,

00:10:17.997 --> 00:10:19.806
and saying to each other,

00:10:19.806 --> 00:10:22.087
"Yeah, this wheel thing,

00:10:22.087 --> 00:10:24.878
cool toy, sure, but compared to fire,

00:10:24.878 --> 00:10:26.994
it will have no impact.

00:10:26.994 --> 00:10:29.318
The big discoveries are all behind us."

00:10:29.318 --> 00:10:31.205
(Laughter)